        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin Wilson, Adrienne Eliza Houghton, Steve French\n- Bands and Projects: Gin Blossoms, The Longshadows, Starclub\n- Roles: lead vocalist, musician, singer-songwriter, recording artist, actress, dancer, television personality, composer, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Wilson was born on July 12, 1965, and he is an American musician.\n- Adrienne Eliza Houghton, née Bailon, was born on October 24, 1983, and she is an American singer-songwriter, recording artist, actress, dancer, and television personality.\n- Robin Wilson is most notable for his work as the lead vocalist of the rock band Gin Blossoms.\n- Steve French was formerly a member of the Britpop band Starclub.\n- The Longshadows were a musical collaboration between Gin Blossoms vocalist Robin Wilson and composer-producer Steve French.",
